  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "There should be a feature to be able to follow world creators similar to something like a subscribing on youtube.  There should be an addition tab labeled \"Followed Creators\" or something similar with the Favorites World tabs.  In this section, it would only show the worlds from the creators you follow in order for newest to oldest.  This would help people keep up with world creators whom they enjoy their content and easily keep up with their latest creations.\n\nIn addition, to be able to follow world creators,  we also should have the ability to ignore world creators.  If I flag someone to ignore, their worlds should no longer show up in my feed or at least have a label over it similar to when you ignore a developer or publisher on steam.  I attached a screenshot of steam as an example.  \n\nI believe this will help people see the worlds they want to see and discover more easier by being able to filter out what they don't want to see.",
